armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1054","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[58,75,24,20,52,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1041","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,75,24,20,52,56],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1450","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将。刘备伐吴期间担任孙桓部将迎战刘备，因吴将李异与张苞对峙时劣势，便放暗箭射杀张苞之马，导致张苞跌落马背。李异趁机举斧欲劈时，关兴及时赶到斩杀李异，蜀军趁势掩杀，孙桓大败。后被关兴所擒获，被张苞斩首以祭其马。","tc":"吳國武將。劉備伐吳期間擔任孫桓部將迎戰劉備，因吳將李異與張苞對峙時劣勢，便放暗箭射殺張苞之馬，導致張苞跌落馬背。李異趁機舉斧欲劈時，關興及時趕到斬殺李異，蜀軍趁勢掩殺，孫桓大敗。后被關興所擒獲，被張苞斬首以祭其馬。","en":"An officer of Wu. During Liu Bei's campaign against Wu, he served as a subordinate general under Sun Huan and fought against Liu Bei's forces. When the Wu general Li Yi was at a disadvantage in his duel with Zhang Bao, he fired a hidden arrow that killed Zhang Bao's horse, causing Zhang Bao to fall from his mount. As Li Yi raised his axe to strike, Guan Xing arrived just in time to slay Li Yi, and the Shu forces pressed their advantage, dealing Sun Huan a heavy defeat. He was later captured by Guan Xing and executed by Zhang Bao as a sacrifice for his horse.","jp":"呉の武将。劉備の呉討伐の際、孫桓の部将として劉備を迎え撃った。呉将の李異が張苞と対峙して劣勢に陥ったため、物陰から矢を放って張苞の馬を射殺し、張苞を落馬させた。李異が好機と見て斧を振り下ろそうとしたところ、間一髪で駆けつけた関興が李異を斬り捨て、蜀軍が勢いに乗じて攻め寄せたため孫桓は大敗した。後に関興に捕らえられ、張苞によって馬を弔うために斬首された。","kr":"오나라의 무장이다. 유비가 오나라를 정벌할 당시 손환의 부장으로 참전하여 유비군에 맞섰다. 오나라 장수 이이가 장포와 맞서다 열세에 몰리자, 암전을 쏘아 장포의 말을 맞혀 쓰러뜨림으로써 장포를 낙마시켰다. 이이가 틈을 타 도끼를 들어 내리치려던 순간 관흥이 때맞춰 달려와 이이를 베었고, 촉군이 기세를 몰아 들이치자 손환은 대패하였다. 이후 관흥에게 사로잡혔으며, 장포에게 참수되어 그 말의 넋을 기리는 제물이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10634","remark":"","surname":"谭","surnameTc":"譚","surnameEn":"Tan","surnameJp":"譚","surnameKr":"담","surnameOther":"","name":"雄","nameTc":"雄","nameEn":"Xiong","nameJp":"雄","nameKr":"웅","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"谭雄","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"207","city":"CS1054","gender":"0","rule":"58","force":"75","wise":"24","politics":"20","charm":"52","will":"56","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"1","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"33/33/33/33/74/5/50/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1019905","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3300","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"100","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/3/1/3/0/1/0/0/0/0/0/1/1/0/2/0/0/0/2/0/0/1/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"88","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1450","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"188","show":"207","death":"221","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1006702","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"1/1;22/1;10/0;25/0;30/1;0/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"吴国武将。刘备伐吴期间担任孙桓部将迎战刘备，因吴将李异与张苞对峙时劣势，便放暗箭射杀张苞之马，导致张苞跌落马背。李异趁机举斧欲劈时，关兴及时赶到斩杀李异，蜀军趁势掩杀，孙桓大败。后被关兴所擒获，被张苞斩首以祭其马。","descriptionTc":"吳國武將。劉備伐吳期間擔任孫桓部將迎戰劉備，因吳將李異與張苞對峙時劣勢，便放暗箭射殺張苞之馬，導致張苞跌落馬背。